{"seq":1,"slug":"container-loading-plan-model","title":"监装方案与装柜计划模型：柜型、堆码与装载率","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/preshipment-inspection-psl-aql/loading-supervision/container-loading-plan-model","wordCount":2971,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"监装方案与装柜计划模型-柜型-堆码与装载率\">监装方案与装柜计划模型：柜型、堆码与装载率</h1><p>一份装柜计划表之所以能决定一批货是 8 个柜还是 9 个柜，是因为它把三维装箱问题压缩成三行可核验数字：<strong>柜型 → 单柜可容纳的外箱数 → 装载率</strong>。监装员在工厂月台核对的第一件事不是货对不对，而是&quot;这票货按计划能不能装进这个柜、重量有没有超&quot;。计划错了，现场再专业的监装也救不回来——只能甩货、改柜或返工。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>**装柜计划（Loading Plan / Stuffing Plan）**是先于装车生成的、把订单明细映射到具体柜型的计算产物；**监装（Loading Supervision）**是现场按计划执行并留证的核对动作。两者是&quot;图纸与施工&quot;：计划定义目标，监装证明实际合规。</p>\n<p>一个可执行的装柜计划同时服从三类硬约束，缺一不可：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约束</th>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>违约后果</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>体积约束</td>\n<td>货物外廓体积 ≤ 柜内体积（须留装卸余量）</td>\n<td>装不下，现场甩货或临时改柜</td>\n<td>SKU 外箱尺寸主数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重量约束</td>\n<td>货重 + 柜皮重 ≤ 最大总重 GM</td>\n<td>无 VGM 或超重则被拒载（SOLAS 强制）</td>\n<td>磅重记录 / 装箱单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>轴荷与偏心</td>\n<td>重心居中、单轴不超道路限值</td>\n<td>拖车违法上路、吊装倾覆</td>\n<td>装载图 + 车板参数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>体积约束最先被算，却最容易被高估——&quot;外箱尺寸&quot;通常是设计值，实际装完箱后鼓包、封箱胶带外凸、托盘出檐会让有效体积缩水 3%–8%。计划里必须预留下沉余量，而非把柜内体积用满。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  ORD[订单明细&lt;br/&gt;SKU 数量 / 单件净重] --&gt; ENGINE[装柜计算引擎]&#10;  SKU[商品主数据&lt;br/&gt;外箱长宽高 / 毛重 / 可堆码层数] --&gt; ENGINE&#10;  CON[柜型库&lt;br/&gt;内尺寸 / 载重 / 门洞尺寸] --&gt; ENGINE&#10;  ENGINE --&gt; PLAN[装柜计划&lt;br/&gt;装载图 + 层序表 + 件数]&#10;  PLAN --&gt; CHK{重量与偏心校核}&#10;  CHK --&gt;|通过| LOCK[封柜指令 + 铅封号]&#10;  CHK --&gt;|超重或偏心| REV[回退重排 / 改用更大柜型]&#10;  REV --&gt; ENGINE&#10;  LOCK --&gt; SUP[现场监装&lt;br/&gt;清点 / 拍照 / 断点记录]\">graph TD\n  ORD[订单明细&lt;br/&gt;SKU 数量 / 单件净重] --&gt; ENGINE[装柜计算引擎]\n  SKU[商品主数据&lt;br/&gt;外箱长宽高 / 毛重 / 可堆码层数] --&gt; ENGINE\n  CON[柜型库&lt;br/&gt;内尺寸 / 载重 / 门洞尺寸] --&gt; ENGINE\n  ENGINE --&gt; PLAN[装柜计划&lt;br/&gt;装载图 + 层序表 + 件数]\n  PLAN --&gt; CHK{重量与偏心校核}\n  CHK --&gt;|通过| LOCK[封柜指令 + 铅封号]\n  CHK --&gt;|超重或偏心| REV[回退重排 / 改用更大柜型]\n  REV --&gt; ENGINE\n  LOCK --&gt; SUP[现场监装&lt;br/&gt;清点 / 拍照 / 断点记录]</pre><p>链条上有两个常见断点：<strong>柜内体积不等于可用体积</strong>（门洞宽高比内尺寸小，大件必须斜进再回正）；<strong>单件毛重不等于可堆码层数</strong>（纸箱标称承压只对静态、短期有效，堆 30 天后底层会蠕变塌陷）。因此计划引擎必须把&quot;可否堆码&quot;作为独立字段读入，不能只按体积整除。装载率同时有体积与重量两个版本，二者常常背离，下节展开。</p>\n<p>装载率作为计划的输出指标，下一节会看到它同时有体积与重量两个版本，二者常常背离。</p>\n<h2 id=\"柜型模型-20gp-40gp-与-40hc-的尺寸与载重三角\">柜型模型：20GP、40GP 与 40HC 的尺寸与载重三角</h2><p>柜型选错是整批货最贵的错误，因为集装箱的三个关键参数——<strong>内体积、最大载重、门洞尺寸</strong>——不能同时最优。标准干货柜参数以 ISO 668（分类、尺寸与额定值）与 ISO 1496-1（通用干货柜规格与试验）为准（<a href=\"https://www.iso.org/standard/28971.html\">ISO 668:2013 / ISO 1496-1:2013</a>）。常见柜型典型值如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>柜型</th>\n<th>内尺寸 长×宽×高 (mm)</th>\n<th>内体积 (m³)</th>\n<th>柜皮重 (kg)</th>\n<th>最大载重 (kg)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>20GP</td>\n<td>5,867 × 2,330 × 2,350</td>\n<td>33.1</td>\n<td>2,200</td>\n<td>28,280</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>40GP</td>\n<td>11,998 × 2,330 × 2,350</td>\n<td>67.5</td>\n<td>3,800</td>\n<td>26,680</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>40HC</td>\n<td>11,998 × 2,330 × 2,654</td>\n<td>75.3</td>\n<td>3,935</td>\n<td>26,545</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>（尺寸与额定值见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Intermodal_container\">Intermodal container — ISO 668/1496</a>；柜皮重随箱体结构浮动，实际以箱门铭牌为准。）这里藏着装柜计划里最反直觉的一点：<strong>40 尺柜的内体积几乎是 20 尺柜的两倍（67.5 / 33.1 ≈ 2.04），最大载重却比 20 尺柜更低（26,680 &lt; 28,280）</strong>。原因在 ISO 668 的额定总重上限——2016 年修订后系列 1 集装箱最大总重为 36,000 kg，40 尺柜自重更大，留给货物的额度反而更少。</p>\n<p>这个三角的工程含义是：<strong>重货走 20 尺、泡货走 40 尺</strong>。钢材、瓷砖、五金件这类密度大于约 500 kg/m³ 的货，20 尺柜往往先触顶重量上限而不是体积上限；家纺、塑料玩具、节日装饰这类密度低于约 250 kg/m³ 的货，40HC 的多出 2.3 m³（相对 40GP）就是纯赚。</p>\n<p>柜型选定后还要过<strong>门洞</strong>这一关。门洞宽高都小于内尺寸（典型 40HC 门洞约 2,340 × 2,585 mm），单件外廓尺寸超过门洞时必须走&quot;斜进—回正&quot;路径，会在计划和现场各产生一次额外校核。大件设备另受<strong>集中载荷</strong>限制：CTU Code 与多数承运人条款约定柜底板集中载荷不超过每 600 mm 柜长约 4.5 t，超限需加铺钢板或方木扩散。</p>\n<h2 id=\"堆码与配载-重货在下-轻货在上与偏心控制\">堆码与配载：重货在下、轻货在上与偏心控制</h2><p>堆码顺序不是审美问题，而是稳定性与合规问题。装柜计划给每一排货物定义<strong>层序（stacking order）</strong>，其原则只有三条，但现场违反率极高。</p>\n<p><strong>第一条，重货在下、轻货在上。</strong> 底层承压最大，若轻货垫底、重货压顶，底层纸箱蠕变塌陷，途中整垛倾覆。计划引擎按单件毛重降序排层序，并校验&quot;上层累计重量 ≤ 下层承压额定值 × 安全系数（0.5–0.6）&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>第二条，重心居中且尽量低。</strong> 承运人普遍要求货物重心偏离柜长中点不超过约定比例（常见为纵向 60/40 分界），横向偏心更严。偏心过大会使吊装时吊具受力不均、拖车板簧两侧载荷分配失衡。</p>\n<p><strong>第三条，纵向与横向都要顶实。</strong> 货前后左右都需用充气袋（dunnage bag）、方木或绑带固定，防止途中滑动撞击柜门。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配载原则</th>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>违规风险</th>\n<th>监装留证点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>重下轻上</td>\n<td>毛重降序 × 承压校核</td>\n<td>底层塌陷、整垛倾覆</td>\n<td>分层照片 + 层序表签字</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重心居中</td>\n<td>纵向偏心 ≤ 约定比例</td>\n<td>吊装倾覆、轴荷失衡</td>\n<td>装载图标注重心线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前后顶实</td>\n<td>空隙 ≤ 约定值，加充气袋/方木</td>\n<td>途中滑移、撞柜门</td>\n<td>关门后侧面照 + 空隙照</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集中载荷</td>\n<td>单位面积 ≤ 柜底额定值</td>\n<td>底板穿损、货物下沉</td>\n<td>单件重量 + 铺垫照片</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>监装员对堆码的核对不是&quot;看一眼&quot;，而是<strong>逐层拍照并与层序表比对</strong>：某层若因现场货物尺寸与主数据不符而临时调整，必须在监装报告上以&quot;断点记录（exception note）&quot;单独说明，否则计划与实物不一致，出事时无法追责。</p>\n<p>堆码还与检验时点耦合：若堆码发生在出货前检验（PSI）之后，被压底层的货物在 PSI 时无法抽查。因此检验顺序（见 <a href=\"../psi-timing-stage/inspection-type-timing-model\">检验类型与时点模型</a>）与抽样方案（见 <a href=\"../aql-sampling-plan/aql-standard-inspection-level\">AQL 标准与检验水平模型</a>）必须先于装柜计划确定——否则抽到的样本与最终装柜的货物不是同一批。</p>\n<h2 id=\"装载率-体积利用率与重量利用率为何背离\">装载率：体积利用率与重量利用率为何背离</h2><p>&quot;装载率&quot;这个词在装柜计划里必须拆成两个数字，因为它们是两条不可能同时拉满的曲线。</p>\n<p><strong>体积利用率</strong>衡量空间用掉多少：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta_v = \\frac{\\sum_i n_i \\, l_i w_i h_i}{V_{in}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2757em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4397em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 种货物的外箱件数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l_i w_i h_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为其外箱体积，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{in}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为柜内体积。</p>\n<p><strong>重量利用率</strong>衡量载重额度用掉多少：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta_w = \\frac{W_{cargo}}{W_{payload,max}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{payload,max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为该柜型最大载重（40HC 为 26,545 kg）。</p>\n<p>两个数字的背离由货物密度决定。机械/五金/瓷砖类重货，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 先逼近 100%，而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta_v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 可能只有 55%–70%（空间浪费在&quot;装不下更多的重量&quot;上）；家纺/玩具类泡货反过来，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta_v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 可到 85%–90%+，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 却只有 30%–40%。因此<strong>用单一装载率评价装柜质量是错的</strong>：抱怨&quot;装载率只有 62%&quot;，很可能那票货本就受重量限制，62% 已是该柜型物理上限。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>货物密度区间</th>\n<th>典型货类</th>\n<th>受限维度</th>\n<th>可达体积利用率</th>\n<th>可达重量利用率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&gt; 500 kg/m³ 重货</td>\n<td>瓷砖、五金、机械</td>\n<td>重量</td>\n<td>55%–70%</td>\n<td>接近 100%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>250–500 kg/m³ 中密度</td>\n<td>小家电、鞋类</td>\n<td>二者接近临界</td>\n<td>70%–85%</td>\n<td>60%–85%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&lt; 250 kg/m³ 泡货</td>\n<td>家纺、玩具、装饰</td>\n<td>体积</td>\n<td>85%–90%+</td>\n<td>30%–45%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>计划引擎的正确定位是<strong>先判断该票货的受限维度，再优化另一个维度</strong>：对重货，把空间尽量塞满以摊薄每立方运费；对泡货，在不超重的余量内尽可能压缩件数、减少甩货风险。判据可写成一句工程规则：密度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>500</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mtext>kg/m</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 500\\ \\text{kg/m}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.204em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">kg/m</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.954em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时放宽体积余量、锁死重量上限；密度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>250</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mtext>kg/m</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 250\\ \\text{kg/m}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.204em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">250</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">kg/m</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.954em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时锁死体积、放宽重量。另需叠加一层损耗：托盘与绑带占额外体积、纸箱鼓包让实际外廓膨胀，计划应按柜型把有效可用体积打 0.92–0.95 的折扣系数，该系数由历史实测装载率反向校准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"装柜计划模型-从订单到装载图的字段与数据流\">装柜计划模型：从订单到装载图的字段与数据流</h2><p>一份能落地的装柜计划，本质是一张把<strong>订单、商品主数据、柜型库</strong>三张表连接起来的计算图。它的最小可用字段集如下。</p>\n<p><strong>输入侧三张表。</strong> 订单/批次表提供 SKU 与件数、交期、目的港；商品主数据提供每个 SKU 的外箱长宽高、毛重、净重、可堆码层数、是否可倒置、单件是否需铺垫；柜型库提供内尺寸、门洞尺寸、柜皮重、最大载重。三者的关键字段&quot;外箱尺寸&quot;与&quot;可堆码层数&quot;必须由同一套实测口径维护——用设计值填主数据、用实际装箱测量值填订单，是装柜计划最常见的偏差来源。</p>\n<p><strong>计算侧。</strong> 引擎按柜型遍历：先按体积粗排得到理论件数，再按重量上限约束回切取小值，然后按堆码层数与门洞尺寸修正，最后输出装载图（按排/层/序标注货物）与层序表。任一约束触发回退，就升级柜型或拆柜重算。</p>\n<p><strong>输出侧三份留证物。</strong> 装载图（给理货与监装）、层序表（给装卸班组）、重量与 VGM 数据（给报关与船公司）。第三份不可选：SOLAS 第 VI 章第 2 条（Container Weight Verification, SOLAS VI/2）自 <strong>2016 年 7 月 1 日</strong>起强制要求装船前取得<strong>验证总重（VGM）</strong>，由**发货人（shipper）**提供，两种方法分别是整柜过磅（方法一）与货物包装分别过磅再加坡皮重（方法二）（<a href=\"https://www.imo.org/\">IMO — SOLAS Verified Gross Mass</a>）。柜型库的柜皮重字段正是方法二的必需输入——装柜计划模型必须与称重流程打通，而非只停留在&quot;排货&quot;。</p>\n<p>现场监装执行时，计划与实物的每一处不一致都要落进报告：实装件数、断点、改层、最终铅封号。计划是事前模型，监装报告是事后证据，两者字段对齐才能在查柜、索赔或平台合规审计时形成可追溯链。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>装柜计划 = 订单 × 商品主数据 × 柜型库的计算产物，先于现场生成；监装 = 按计划核对并留证。</li>\n<li>三类硬约束同时成立：体积、重量（SOLAS VGM 强制）、轴荷与偏心。</li>\n<li>柜型三角不可同时最优：40 尺体积近两倍于 20 尺，最大载重反而更低（ISO 668 额定总重上限 36,000 kg），重货走 20 尺、泡货走 40 尺。</li>\n<li>堆码三原则：重下轻上（承压 × 安全系数）、重心居中且低、前后顶实；大件另校集中载荷。</li>\n<li>装载率必须拆成体积利用率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta_v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与重量利用率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，二者按货物密度背离；先判断受限维度再优化另一个。</li>\n<li>计划输出须含装载图、层序表、VGM 数据三份留证物；监装报告与计划字段对齐才能形成可追溯链。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  A[柜型尺寸与载重] --&gt; B[体积约束]&#10;  A --&gt; C[重量约束]&#10;  A --&gt; D[偏心与集中载荷]&#10;  B --&gt; E[装载图]&#10;  C --&gt; E&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[层序表]&#10;  E --&gt; G[VGM 数据]&#10;  F --&gt; H[现场监装留证]&#10;  G --&gt; H\">graph LR\n  A[柜型尺寸与载重] --&gt; B[体积约束]\n  A --&gt; C[重量约束]\n  A --&gt; D[偏心与集中载荷]\n  B --&gt; E[装载图]\n  C --&gt; E\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[层序表]\n  E --&gt; G[VGM 数据]\n  F --&gt; H[现场监装留证]\n  G --&gt; H</pre>","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"监装方案与装柜计划模型：柜型、堆码与装载率","id":"监装方案与装柜计划模型-柜型-堆码与装载率"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"柜型模型：20GP、40GP 与 40HC 的尺寸与载重三角","id":"柜型模型-20gp-40gp-与-40hc-的尺寸与载重三角"},{"level":2,"text":"堆码与配载：重货在下、轻货在上与偏心控制","id":"堆码与配载-重货在下-轻货在上与偏心控制"},{"level":2,"text":"装载率：体积利用率与重量利用率为何背离","id":"装载率-体积利用率与重量利用率为何背离"},{"level":2,"text":"装柜计划模型：从订单到装载图的字段与数据流","id":"装柜计划模型-从订单到装载图的字段与数据流"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"缺陷分级判定：致命/严重/轻微缺陷的实操界定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/preshipment-inspection-psl-aql/aql-sampling-plan/defect-class-critical-major-minor"},"next":{"title":"监装执行与封条核验机制：过程记录与证据链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/preshipment-inspection-psl-aql/loading-supervision/loading-supervision-seal-verification"}}